OL,5,G0232 The Documentary
OL,6,     FThere are more than 730 sinkholes
OL,7,     Fin central Turkey, and their
OL,8,     Fnumbers are surging, threatening
OL,9,     Ffarmland and food supplies. They
OL,10,     Fare nature's response to
OL,11,     Funsustainable water use.
